\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 # Kiki V\'e0 H\'f2n \uc0\u272 \u7843 o Chu\u7889 i B\'ed M\u7853 t\
\
S\'e1ng s\uc0\u7899 m trong khu r\u7915 ng nhi\u7879 t \u273 \u7899 i, ch\'fa kh\u7881  nh\u7887  **Kiki** \u273 ang ng\u7891 i \u259 n s\'e1ng tr\'ean c\'e0nh c\'e2y.\
\
B\uc0\u7895 ng m\u7897 t ch\'fa v\u7865 t bay ngang qua v\'e0 k\u7875 :\
\
\'97 Ngo\'e0i con s\'f4ng l\uc0\u7899 n kia c\'f3 m\u7897 t h\'f2n \u273 \u7843 o \u273 \u7847 y nh\u7919 ng c\'e2y chu\u7889 i ch\'edn v\'e0ng!\
\
Kiki su\'fdt l\'e0m r\uc0\u417 i qu\u7843  chu\u7889 i tr\'ean tay.\
\
\'97 Th\uc0\u7853 t sao?\
\
\'97 Th\uc0\u7853 t ch\u7913 ! Nh\u432 ng ch\u432 a ai trong khu r\u7915 ng \u273 \u7871 n \u273 \'f3 c\u7843 !\
\
Nghe v\uc0\u7853 y, Kiki quy\u7871 t \u273 \u7883 nh l\'ean \u273 \u432 \u7901 ng.\
\
\uc0\u272 \'e2y s\u7869  l\'e0 chuy\u7871 n phi\'eau l\u432 u l\u7899 n nh\u7845 t t\u7915  tr\u432 \u7899 c \u273 \u7871 n nay c\u7911 a c\u7853 u.\
\
Kiki chuy\uc0\u7873 n t\u7915  c\'e0nh c\'e2y n\'e0y sang c\'e0nh c\'e2y kh\'e1c.\
\
Nh\uc0\u7919 ng c\'e1nh tay d\'e0i kh\u7887 e m\u7841 nh gi\'fap c\u7853 u \u273 u r\u7845 t nhanh qua c\'e1c t\'e1n c\'e2y cao.\
\
\uc0\u272 \u7871 n tr\u432 a, Kiki g\u7863 p m\u7897 t kho\u7843 ng tr\u7889 ng l\u7899 n gi\u7919 a hai c\'e2y c\u7893  th\u7909 .\
\
\'97 Xa qu\'e1!\
\
C\uc0\u7853 u l\'f9i l\u7841 i v\'e0i b\u432 \u7899 c r\u7891 i b\u7853 t m\u7841 nh.\
\
V\'fat!\
\
Kiki \uc0\u273 \'e1p xu\u7889 ng c\'e0nh c\'e2y b\'ean kia m\u7897 t c\'e1ch ho\'e0n h\u7843 o.\
\
\'97 May qu\'e1! \'97 c\uc0\u7853 u c\u432 \u7901 i t\u432 \u417 i.\
\
\uc0\u272 i ti\u7871 p m\u7897 t l\'fac, Kiki nghe th\u7845 y ti\u7871 ng n\u432 \u7899 c ch\u7843 y.\
\
Con s\'f4ng l\uc0\u7899 n \u273 \'e3 hi\u7879 n ra.\
\
Nh\uc0\u432 ng h\'f2n \u273 \u7843 o chu\u7889 i v\u7851 n c\'f2n \u7903  ph\'eda b\'ean kia.\
\
Kiki ng\uc0\u7891 i suy ngh\u297 .\
\
B\uc0\u7895 ng c\u7853 u nh\'ecn th\u7845 y m\u7897 t th\'e2n c\'e2y \u273 \u7893  b\u7855 c ngang m\u7863 t n\u432 \u7899 c.\
\
\'97 M\'ecnh bi\uc0\u7871 t ph\u7843 i l\'e0m g\'ec r\u7891 i!\
\
C\uc0\u7849 n th\u7853 n gi\u7919  th\u259 ng b\u7857 ng b\u7857 ng chi\u7871 c \u273 u\'f4i d\'e0i, Kiki t\u7915  t\u7915  b\u432 \u7899 c qua.\
\
Cu\uc0\u7889 i c\'f9ng...\
\
H\'f2n \uc0\u273 \u7843 o chu\u7889 i b\'ed m\u7853 t \u273 \'e3 \u7903  ngay tr\u432 \u7899 c m\u7855 t!\
\
Nh\uc0\u7919 ng bu\u7891 ng chu\u7889 i v\'e0ng \'f3ng treo l\u7911 ng l\u7859 ng kh\u7855 p n\u417 i.\
\
Kiki vui s\uc0\u432 \u7899 ng ch\u7841 y kh\u7855 p \u273 \u7843 o.\
\
Nh\uc0\u432 ng r\u7891 i c\u7853 u nh\u7853 n ra \u273 i\u7873 u th\'fa v\u7883  h\u417 n c\u7843  nh\u7919 ng qu\u7843  chu\u7889 i.\
\
Tr\'ean \uc0\u273 \u7843 o c\'f3 r\u7845 t nhi\u7873 u lo\'e0i c\'e2y, lo\'e0i chim v\'e0 c\'f4n tr\'f9ng m\'e0 c\u7853 u ch\u432 a t\u7915 ng g\u7863 p.\
\
\'97 Th\uc0\u7871  gi\u7899 i r\u7897 ng l\u7899 n h\u417 n m\'ecnh t\u432 \u7903 ng r\u7845 t nhi\u7873 u! \'97 Kiki th\'edch th\'fa n\'f3i.\
\
Khi m\uc0\u7863 t tr\u7901 i b\u7855 t \u273 \u7847 u l\u7863 n, Kiki tr\u7903  v\u7873  khu r\u7915 ng c\u7911 a m\'ecnh.\
\
C\'e1c b\uc0\u7841 n \u273 \u7897 ng v\u7853 t l\u7853 p t\u7913 c ch\u7841 y \u273 \u7871 n h\u7887 i:\
\
\'97 H\'f2n \uc0\u273 \u7843 o c\'f3 th\u7853 t kh\'f4ng?\
\
\'97 C\'f3 ch\uc0\u7913 ! \'97 Kiki c\u432 \u7901 i l\u7899 n.\
\
\'97 Nh\uc0\u432 ng \u273 i\u7873 u tuy\u7879 t v\u7901 i nh\u7845 t kh\'f4ng ph\u7843 i nh\u7919 ng qu\u7843  chu\u7889 i.\
\
\'97 M\'e0 l\'e0 nh\uc0\u7919 ng \u273 i\u7873 u m\u7899 i m\u7867  m\'ecnh \u273 \u432 \u7907 c kh\'e1m ph\'e1 tr\'ean \u273 \u432 \u7901 ng \u273 i.\
\
T\uc0\u7915  \u273 \'f3, Kiki hi\u7875 u r\u7857 ng m\u7895 i chuy\u7871 n phi\'eau l\u432 u \u273 \u7873 u mang \u273 \u7871 n nh\u7919 ng \u273 i\u7873 u b\u7845 t ng\u7901  v\'e0 th\'fa v\u7883 .
